            "Retry statuses {green:429, 502, 503, 504}: overload or a restarting upstream",
            "**Never** retry {red:400, 401, 403, 404, 422}: the same request fails again",
            "Retry only ==idempotent== calls: GET, PUT, DELETE are safe",
            "POST is retried **only** with an `Idempotency-Key` header"
          ],
          "style": "check",
          "frame": "dashed",
